        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '"Took you long enough to get here, but I can see why now. You''re
          driving this whale through the city! What kinda wimp takes an RV to go
          camping?!?!" Says Willie, clearly with some disdain in his eyes.'
